HzzJ8cs_text","label":"ggfBHzzJ8cs_text","default":"3 Months"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFcpn59wIY_text","label":"ggFcpn59wIY_text","default":"<p>See a visible difference in your physique—leaner, more defined muscles&nbsp;and reduced body fat. With the hormonal balance restored, your body will feel stronger, more energized, and youthful again.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfKL99KbYj_text","label":"ggfKL99KbYj_text","default":"6 Months"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9dxJuDTJX_text","label":"gg9dxJuDTJX_text","default":"6 Months"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtB_kAlkPw_text","label":"ggtB_kAlkPw_text","default":"<p>In peak condition improved&nbsp;muscle function, faster recovery after workouts,&nbsp;enhanced mental clarity. The combination of &nbsp;Colostrum and Ashwagandha supports both physical and mental well being.*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg46wWRzfDP_text","label":"gg46wWRzfDP_text","default":"12 Months"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4gowKFgg3_text","label":"gg4gowKFgg3_text","default":"12 Months"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQuzzywrup_text","label":"ggQuzzywrup_text","default":"<p>Enjoy a completely transformed lifestyle with long-lasting benefits—optimized testosterone levels, steady energy, and sustained muscle growth. You’ll feel stronger, healthier, and more confident, having achieved the physique and energy levels you’ve always wanted.*</p>"}],
